stem.</b><br><b>\n</b><br>Believing that skillful workers are the key to productivity and that each employee is a teacher and can help guide others to learn and grow, he establised a core team in charge of essential courses for employees, especially in electronics field, thus creating the main force to help reach the 100 million dollar vision.<br><br>Especially, Mr. Dung Tran is the one who builds career development orientation for employee as soon as they join in Spartronics Vietnam, directly involves in training and guidance of both soft skills and job expertise.<br>\n<br>Furthermore, Talkshow \"Leadership Counseling Program\" is an opportunity to bridge the gap between leaders and employees. He does not hesitate to spend his precious time to advise and help them when they have troubles in work as well as in life.<br>\n<br>He pays great attention to building vision and executing strategy, as well as building culture identity, raising trust, and developing and attracting talents. These are what motivate <b><i>Spartronics Vietnam to maintain Top 1 position in the group for many years.&nbsp;</i></b><br><br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
