pe !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/maricostory-4.jpg\" alt>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style pt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n                    Image Description</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Ambitious vision accompanied by strong leadership and culture</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                        Hit the ground running, Vaibhav had a bold vision for his new team in July 2021 to become the fastest-growing company in South-East Asia, resting on three growth pillars: <b>Strengthening the core, expanding the portfolio, and achieving commercial excellence.</b></p>\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                        However, the new strategy had met with strong disbelief as a result of inconsistent performance and failure to innovate over the years. To boost morale and allow teams to feel invested in the success of the strategy, Vaibhav has led his new crew to introduce several practices to align the organization and build a strong culture within Marico SEA.  These include <b>engagement exercises</b> that were designed to work through channels such as quarterly leadership connects, 1-on-1 skip meetings, function-wise communications, <b>leadership localization and diversity</b> to generate positive response from members towards career growth opportunities and help to leverage local business insights to drive success. </p>\n\n                </div>           \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
