ple, nurturing potential, and driving impact. We see our leaders as People Champions - those who not only deliver on objectives but also commit to attracting, developing, and retaining talent.<br><br> By empowering individuals and fostering deep engagement, SGVN’s leadership creates an environment where people thrive, innovation flourishes, and sustainable performance becomes reality.<br> \n<br>This people-centric approach earned SGVN the Vietnam Excellence 2025 Award for Visionary Leadership, a testament to its belief that great business performance begins with great leadership for people.&nbsp;<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
